{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seconds Till Destruction</strong> is a lightning fast, randomized top-down shooter played in six second bursts. Warp onto different floors, kill them all, then do it again! Pick up and play for instant action, or try to clear as many floors as you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANDOMIZED ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/extras/seconds_steam_4_alt.gif?t=1750807048\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, dash, and shoot your way through <u>50+ unique floors</u>! Enemy spawns, floor order, and weapon choices are randomized every time, so no two runs are the same!*<strong><i>\u00a0</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GUNS GALORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/extras/seconds_steam_3_alt.gif?t=1750807048\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield an arsenal of <u>30+ weapons</u> to use in your runs, like the reliable Auto Shotgun or the OSHA-violating Sawblade Launcher. We've got Laser Guns, Flamethrowers, and Railguns too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPICE IT UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <u>15+ unique Mutators</u> to customize the game any way you like. Slow down time, go invisible, shrink your enemies, and more!\u00a0Or play the <u>Mutator Roulette</u> mode for a random mutator on every floor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GO FOR THE GOLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rack up high scores to unlock new weapons and Mutators to use in your runs. If that's not enough, try going for all <u>25 achievements</u>! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BASED ON TRUE EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seconds Till Destruction is an accurate depiction of future events**, where a killer robot will attempt to destroy all of humanity. You have been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Probably. We didn't do the math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**In at least one possible timeline. No guarantees we're living in it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008800?t=1750807048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750807048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/d6a015a38133f78cd5e82147bc71ac288e027d22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750807048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/d6a015a38133f78cd5e82147bc71ac288e027d22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750807048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains pixelated blood and gore. Enemies bleed when shot, get dismembered from explosives, and burn from incendiary weapons. There is a low violence toggle to disable these elements."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seconds Till Destruction</strong> is a lightning fast, randomized top-down shooter played in six second bursts. Warp onto different floors, kill them all, then do it again! Pick up and play for instant action, or try to clear as many floors as you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANDOMIZED ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/extras/seconds_steam_4_alt.gif?t=1750807048\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, dash, and shoot your way through <u>50+ unique floors</u>! Enemy spawns, floor order, and weapon choices are randomized every time, so no two runs are the same!*<strong><i>\u00a0</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GUNS GALORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/extras/seconds_steam_3_alt.gif?t=1750807048\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield an arsenal of <u>30+ weapons</u> to use in your runs, like the reliable Auto Shotgun or the OSHA-violating Sawblade Launcher. We've got Laser Guns, Flamethrowers, and Railguns too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPICE IT UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <u>15+ unique Mutators</u> to customize the game any way you like. Slow down time, go invisible, shrink your enemies, and more!\u00a0Or play the <u>Mutator Roulette</u> mode for a random mutator on every floor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GO FOR THE GOLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rack up high scores to unlock new weapons and Mutators to use in your runs. If that's not enough, try going for all <u>25 achievements</u>! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BASED ON TRUE EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seconds Till Destruction is an accurate depiction of future events**, where a killer robot will attempt to destroy all of humanity. You have been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Probably. We didn't do the math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**In at least one possible timeline. No guarantees we're living in it.</p>","developers":["The Eagle Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008800/header.jpg?t=1750807048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u